node_modules/
dist/
.env
.env.local
*.log
package-lock.json
data/raw/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
data/*.db
.mypy_cache/
# Contains the OpenAlgo API key (see Phase 0 report) — never commit.
opencode.json

# Personal/local overrides — see .claude skills' update-config guidance.
.claude/settings.local.json

# OpenAlgo runtime state (mounted volumes; regenerated on container start).
db/
log/

# OpenAlgo's Python Strategy Management folder. `docker-compose.yml` mounts
# `./strategies` into the OpenAlgo container, whose `blueprints/python_strategy.py`
# writes `strategies/strategy_configs.json` on start. Nothing of OURS lives here
# any more — the legacy pre-rewrite `strategies` package was deleted on
# 2026-08-10 (the engine's strategy on/off switches live in SQLite, see
# `te/engine/strategy_config.py`). The directory must still EXIST as the bind
# mount point, so keep ignoring its contents rather than deleting it.
# ANCHORED — see the `/data/` note below for what a bare rule costs.
/strategies/

# Python build/test artifacts.
.pytest_cache/
.coverage
*.egg-info/

# Leftover data/model artifacts from the pre-rewrite engine.
# ANCHORED to the repo root. A bare `data/` matches a directory of that name
# at ANY depth, which silently untracked all 16 modules of the `te.data`
# SOURCE package — the bar store, the recorder, the bhavcopy ingest and the
# point-in-time gate — for as long as this rule has existed. Found on
# 2026-08-03 when a new function in `te/data/ingest_log.py` failed to show
# up in `git status`. Keep the leading slash.
/data/
engine/data/

# Bare-host dev engine's isolated dev DB/bar store (yarn dev:engine / dev:all)
# — see engine/.env.
engine/data-local/
